-- The General Conditions ("ĐIỀU KIỆN CHUNG") 1-9, lines 55-145 of
-- ../../source/raw/baominh-car.txt. Quotations are generated by `tools/vnsrc.py quote`.
--
-- TIME. Dates are calendar dates (`daydate`). The regulative clauses run on a clock of
-- whole calendar days, day 0 being the day the clause starts to run (the occurrence, the
-- written request); the document counts its 14 days in "ngày" and its periods of one and
-- three months in "tháng", and defines neither (forks F12, F15, F16).

§ `General Conditions`
-- src:55 | ĐIỀU KIỆN CHUNG

§§ `General Condition 1 — compliance and true answers are a condition precedent`

-- Compliance with every term about what the Insured must do, and the truth of the answers
-- in the questionnaire and the proposal, are a condition precedent to Bảo Minh's liability.
-- No test of materiality or of causal connection with the loss is stated, so any breach of
-- any duty below defeats the claim (fork F9; findings X5, X6). The duties are encoded one
-- by one under their own Conditions and gathered here.
-- src:57 | 1. Với Người được bảo hiểm tuân thủ và chấp hành đúng các Điều khoản của Đơn bảo hiểm này
-- src:58 | về những việc mà Người được bảo hiểm có nghĩa vụ phải làm hay thực hiện và việc khai báo
-- src:59 | trả lời các câu hỏi trong Bản câu hỏi và giấy yêu cầu bảo hiểm sẽ là điều kiện tiên quyết để
-- src:60 | ràng buộc trách nhiệm bồi thường của Bảo Minh.
@ref General Condition 1, lines 57-60, with General Conditions 3, 4, 5 and 6
GIVEN r                    IS A `The Insured's conduct of the risk`
      a                    IS A `The Insured's conduct after the occurrence`
      `the loss is by theft` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 1 — the conditions precedent to liability are met` r a `the loss is by theft` MEANS
        r's `the answers in the questionnaire and the proposal were true`
    AND `General Condition 3 — precautions and recommendations were followed` r
    AND `General Condition 4(a) — the information needed to assess the risk was given` r
    AND `General Condition 4(b) — a material change was notified and provided for` r
    AND `General Condition 4 — no material change increasing the risk was made without written approval` r
    AND `General Condition 5(a)-(e) — the Insured did what an occurrence requires` a `the loss is by theft`
    AND `General Condition 5 — no damage that was not minor was repaired before an inspection` a
    AND `General Condition 6 — the Insured did what subrogation requires` r

§§ `General Condition 2 — the Schedule is part of the Policy; a term keeps its meaning`

-- INERT. The Schedule and the following parts form part of "this Policy", and a word given a
-- meaning anywhere in the Policy keeps it wherever it appears. The document itself gives
-- no word a meaning, so the rule has nothing to fix here; it is the reason "hạng mục"
-- cannot silently change meaning between the insuring clause and exclusion (d) (fork F22,
-- finding X14) and why "Trọng tài chung" used for two roles is a defect (finding X9).
