§§ `General Condition 5 — what the Insured must do after an occurrence`

-- (a) notice: immediately, by telephone OR telegram, AND in writing, stating the nature and
-- extent of the loss. "Lập tức" (immediately) has no period: whether the notice was
-- immediate is a fact supplied with the case (fork F11; finding X5).
-- src:86 | 5. Trong trường hợp xảy ra những sự cố có thể dẫn đến việc bồi thường theo Đơn bảo hiểm này,
