-- src:90 | bản, nêu rõ tính chất và mức độ tổn thất,
@ref General Condition 5(a), lines 86-90
GIVEN n IS A `The notice of an occurrence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 5(a) — notice was given as required` n MEANS
        n's `given immediately`
    AND n's `by telephone or telegram`
    AND n's `in writing`
    AND n's `stating the nature and extent of the loss`

-- (b) to (d): minimise the loss; preserve the damaged parts for inspection; furnish the
-- information and documents Bảo Minh requires. (e) inform the police where the loss is
-- by theft.
