GIVEN a                    IS A `The Insured's conduct after the occurrence`
      `the loss is by theft` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 5(a)-(e) — the Insured did what an occurrence requires` a `the loss is by theft` MEANS
        `General Condition 5(a) — notice was given as required` (a's `the notice`)
    AND a's `took all steps within its power to minimise the loss`
    AND a's `preserved the damaged parts and made them available for inspection`
    AND a's `furnished the information and documents Bao Minh required`
    AND ((NOT `the loss is by theft`) OR a's `informed the police`)

§§ `General Condition 5 — the 14-day bar on notice`

-- "Trong mọi trường hợp": whatever else, Bảo Minh is not liable for a loss of which it has
-- not RECEIVED notice within 14 days from the day of the occurrence. Read as calendar days,
-- the day of the occurrence not counted, so notice received on the fourteenth day after it
-- is in time and on the fifteenth is not (fork F12).
-- src:102 | Trong mọi trường hợp, Bảo Minh sẽ không chịu trách nhiệm đối với tổn thất hay trách nhiệm,
-- src:103 | nếu trong vòng 14 ngày kể từ ngày xảy ra sự cố Bảo Minh không nhận được thông báo tổn
-- src:104 | thất.
@ref General Condition 5, lines 102-104
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of days from the occurrence within which Bao Minh must receive notice` MEANS 14

@ref General Condition 5, lines 102-104
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day on which Bao Minh may receive notice of an occurrence on` d MEANS
    d PLUS `the number of days from the occurrence within which Bao Minh must receive notice`

@ref General Condition 5, lines 102-104
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      n IS A `The notice of an occurrence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 5 — Bao Minh received notice within 14 days of the occurrence on` d n MEANS
    CONSIDER n's `the date Bao Minh received the notice`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST r  THEN r AT MOST `the last day on which Bao Minh may receive notice of an occurrence on` d

-- The same duty as a regulative rule, on the day clock (day 0 is the day of the
-- occurrence). The text's duty is to notify "immediately"; its sanction is the 14-day
-- bar, which is what the deadline encodes.
