§§ `General Condition 8 — fraud, and the time-bar after an award`

-- Four limbs, any one of which forfeits all benefit under the Policy. The first three are
-- fraud: a fraudulent claim, a false declaration made or used in support of it, fraudulent
-- means or devices used by the Insured or anyone on its behalf.
-- src:136 | 8. Nếu có sự khiếu nại gian lận hay khai báo sai (được đưa ra hay hỗ trợ cho khiếu nại đó) hay
-- src:137 | nếu Người được bảo hiểm hoặc Người thay mặt họ sử dụng những phương tiện hay thủ đoạn
-- src:138 | gian lận nhằm kiếm lời qua Đơn bảo hiểm này hoặc nếu khiếu nại đòi bồi thường bị khước từ
@ref General Condition 8, lines 136-138
GIVEN h IS A `The history of a claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 8 — the claim is tainted by fraud or a false declaration` h MEANS
        h's `the claim is fraudulent`
    OR  h's `a false declaration was made or used in support of the claim`
    OR  h's `fraudulent means or devices were used by or for the Insured to obtain a benefit`

-- The fourth limb, as the Vietnamese has it: a claim rejected, AND no proceedings within
-- three months of the award of "hai Trọng tài viên hay Trọng tài chung", where there has
-- been an arbitration. There is no clock that runs from the rejection itself (fork F16;
-- finding X10). Three calendar months from the date of the award; proceedings on the last
-- day are in time.
-- src:138 | gian lận nhằm kiếm lời qua Đơn bảo hiểm này hoặc nếu khiếu nại đòi bồi thường bị khước từ
-- src:139 | mà khôngg có việc tiến hành tố tụng trong vòng ba tháng kể từ khi hai Trọng tài viên hay
-- src:140 | Trọng tài chung đưa ra phán quyết, trường hợp đưa ra trọng tài như quy định ở trên thì tất cả
-- src:141 | các quyền lợi theo đơn bảo hiểm này sẽ không có giá trị.
@ref General Condition 8, lines 138-141
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day to commence proceedings after an award made on` d MEANS
    `add months` d 3

-- An award by any of the three: "Trọng tài chung" is the single arbitrator in one sentence
-- of General Condition 7 and the umpire in the next, so the reading taken lets it stand for
-- either (fork F16; finding X9).
@ref General Condition 8, line 140
GIVEN w IS A `Who made an award`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the General Condition 8 clock starts on an award made by` w MEANS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `a single arbitrator appointed by both parties` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the two arbitrators`                           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the umpire appointed by the two arbitrators`   THEN TRUE

@ref General Condition 8, lines 138-141
GIVEN h IS A `The history of a claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 8 — the time-bar after an award has run` h MEANS
        h's `the claim was rejected`
    AND CONSIDER h's `the award`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
        WHEN JUST aw THEN     `the General Condition 8 clock starts on an award made by` (aw's `made by`)
                          AND h's `as at` GREATER THAN `the last day to commence proceedings after an award made on` (aw's `the date of the award`)
                          AND CONSIDER h's `the date proceedings were commenced`
                              WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
                              WHEN JUST pd THEN pd GREATER THAN `the last day to commence proceedings after an award made on` (aw's `the date of the award`)

@ref General Condition 8, lines 136-141
GIVEN h IS A `The history of a claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 8 — all benefit under the Policy is forfeited` h MEANS
        `General Condition 8 — the claim is tainted by fraud or a false declaration` h
    OR  `General Condition 8 — the time-bar after an award has run` h

§§ `General Condition 9 — other insurance`

-- If another insurance covers the same loss or liability when the claim arises, Bảo Minh
-- pays no more than "tỷ lệ của họ", its rateable proportion. The policy does not say how
-- the proportion is reckoned, so a claim with other insurance is declined by name (fork
-- F17; finding X12). A caller who has the proportion can apply it with the second rule.
-- src:143 | 9. Nếu vào thời điểm phát sinh khiếu nại theo Đơn bảo hiểm này mà có bất kỳ một Đơn bảo
-- src:144 | hiểm nào khác cũng bảo hiểm tổn thất vật chất hay trách nhiệm đó thì Bảo Minh sẽ không bồi
-- src:145 | thường nhiều hơn tỷ lệ của họ trong khiếu nại về tổn thất vật chất hay trách nhiệm đó
@ref General Condition 9, lines 143-145
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`General Condition 9 limits Bao Minh to a rateable proportion that the policy does not define` MEANS
    REFUSE "General Condition 9 limits Bao Minh to a rateable proportion that the policy does not define"

@ref General Condition 9, lines 143-145
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      proportion IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`General Condition 9 — the most Bao Minh pays of` amount `at a rateable proportion of` proportion MEANS
    amount TIMES proportion
